    "notes": "Audit reports are listed only where the COA file page was opened (2019, 2023, 2024) or COA's own page appeared in search with its title and posting date (2021, 2022). The 2020 and 2025 pages could not be reached on 2026-11-03 (COA's server timed out), so they are not listed; they may exist. Links go to COA's file page, not the ZIP, because the files are large (up to 35 MB). FOI reply due dates follow EO 2 (15 working days)."
